@token = <PASTE_TOKEN_HASIL_LOGIN_DISINI>

### Register User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Test User",
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Ambil Semua Kategori
GET http://localhost:5000/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tambah Kategori Baru
POST http://localhost:5000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Makanan",
  "type": "expense",
  "icon": "🍔"
}

### Update Kategori
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Makanan & Minuman",
  "type": "expense",
  "icon": "🍔"
}

### Hapus Kategori
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/categories/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ambil Semua Transaksi
GET http://localhost:5000/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ambil Transaksi dengan Filter Tanggal
GET http://localhost:5000/api/transactions?start_date=2026-07-01&end_date=2026-07-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ambil Transaksi dengan Filter Kategori & Keyword
GET http://localhost:5000/api/transactions?category_id=1&keyword=Makan Siang
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tambah Transaksi Baru
POST http://localhost:5000/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Makan Siang",
  "amount": 35000,
  "type": "expense",
  "transaction_date": "2026-07-23",
  "category_id": 6
}

### Update Transaksi
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/transactions/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Makan Siang di Kantin",
  "amount": 30000,
  "type": "expense",
  "transaction_date": "2026-07-23",
  "category_id": 1
}

### Ubah Tipe Transaksi
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/transactions/1/toggle-type
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hapus Transaksi
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/transactions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ringkasan Dashboard
GET http://localhost:5000/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ringkasan Dashboard dengan Rentang Tanggal
GET http://localhost:5000/api/dashboard/summary?start_date=2026-07-01&end_date=2026-07-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Agregasi per Kategori (semua tipe)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/dashboard/by-category
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Agregasi per Kategori (khusus expense)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/dashboard/by-category?type=expense
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tren Bulanan
GET http://localhost:5000/api/dashboard/monthly-trend
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}